WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.220
Look inside a plant cell,
then inside one of your own.

2
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:08.130
Both have a nucleus,
mitochondria, ribosomes,

3
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.640
ER and a Golgi.

4
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.050
Fungal cells have every
one of those parts as well.

5
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.780
So if a plant cell shares
most of its parts with yours,

6
00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:20.540
what does it have that
yours lacks, and why?

7
00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:25.810
In this mission, you'll line up animal,
plant and fungal cells side by side.

8
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.370
Then you'll compare
them feature by feature,

9
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.250
and find out what each difference is for.

10
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.970
Your mission: find out what a plant
cell has that yours lacks, and why.
